# reset-all-frames (H7): a=3, h=2; Reset all eases both back together while
# the boxes show 1.00 and 0.00 at once. Same frame ladder as reset-frames.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query func=x2&a=3&h=2
wait 2000
click 348.6 402.5
shot reset-all-f0
frames reset-all-f100 every 100 for 100
frames reset-all-f200 every 100 for 100
frames reset-all-f700 every 500 for 500
frames reset-all-f1000 every 300 for 300
